DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261016T113000
DTSTAMP:20261013T194611Z
UID:grassrootsecology-alviso-san-jose-burrowing-owl-project@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us to improve habitat for the threatened South Bay burrow
 ing owl population. This opportunity is for those aged 18+.\n\nGrassroots 
