 dult and a minor waiver is required. Tools and gloves provided.\n\nAges: A
 ll ages (under-13 with adult\, minor waiver required)\nRegistration: requi
 red\nSource: https://www.grassrootsecology.org/event-calendar/2026/10/16/a
 lviso-san-jose-burrowing-owl-project\nLast synced: 2026-10-13 12:46 PDT
LOCATION:Burrowing Owl Project (map)
URL:https://www.grassrootsecology.org/event-calendar/2026/10/16/alviso-san
 -jose-burrowing-owl-project
END:VEVENT
